":"p","text":"Implement it using Excel, SQL, or a simple web application."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Predictive Quality Model"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a machine-learning model that predicts finished-paper quality from:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fiber characteristics"},{"text":"Pulp parameters"},{"text":"Moisture"},{"text":"Machine speed"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Coating parameters"},{"text":"Chemical dosage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Output:"},{"type":"p","text":"Predicted quality + potential quality-risk alert."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Integrated paper mills"},{"text":"Pulp manufacturing plants"},{"text":"Paper coating plants"},{"text":"Packaging-paper manufacturers"},{"text":"Specialty paper manufacturers"},{"text":"Printing-paper companies"},{"text":"Tissue manufacturers"},{"text":"Paper-chemical suppliers"},{"text":"Quality testing laboratories"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best departments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Quality Control"},{"text":"Quality Assurance"},{"text":"Process Engineering"},{"text":"Laboratory"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Coating"},{"text":"R&D"},{"text":"Customer Quality"},{"text":"Supplier Quality"},{"text":"A plant-floor quality internship is particularly valuable."}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Quality Engineer"},{"text":"QC Engineer"},{"text":"Quality Control Executive"},{"text":"Laboratory Engineer"},{"text":"Quality Assurance Executive"},{"text":"Process Quality Engineer"},{"text":"Paper Testing Engineer"},{"text":"Coating Quality Engineer"},{"text":"Process Engineer"},{"text":"Quality Analyst"},{"text":"Customer Quality Engineer"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Quality Engineer","Senior Quality Engineer","Quality Executive / Quality Speciali