":"Technical Quality Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["Quality Engineer","Process Quality Engineer","Senior Process Quality Engineer","Process Improvement Lead","Manufacturing Excellence Manager","Operations / Quality Leadership"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI-Based Quality Prediction"},{"type":"p","text":"Machine learning can identify relationships between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Raw-material properties"},{"text":"Process parameters"},{"text":"Coating conditions"},{"text":"Machine settings"},{"text":"Final product quality"},{"text":"Raw Material Data"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Process Data"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Machine Data"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Laboratory Data","Machine Learning","Quality Prediction","Early Intervention"]},{"type":"h","text":"Computer Vision"},{"type":"p","text":"Can support automated inspection of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Surface defects"},{"text":"Coating defects"},{"text":"Spots"},{"text":"Streaks"},{"text":"Wrinkles"},{"text":"Printing defects"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Quality Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Future factories will increasingly connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sensors","SCADA / MES","LIMS","QMS","ERP","Quality Analytics"]},{"type":"h","text":"Predictive Quality"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of testing quality only after production, plants can increasingly predict quality during the manufacturing process."},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainable Quality"},{"type":"p","text":"Quality managers will increasingly balance product performance with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"Water consumption"},{"text":"Chemical usage"},{"text":"Fiber efficiency"},{"text":"Waste"},{"text":"Recyclability"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pulp & Paper Technology"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Coating Technology"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Paper Testing"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Quality Control"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Quality Assurance"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SPC + Six Sigma"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Root-Cause Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CAPA"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Quality Management Systems"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Minitab / JMP"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Excel + Power BI"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"LIMS / QMS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Process Analytics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Industry Internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand pulp and paper manufacturing."},{"text":"Understand paper and coating processes."},{"text":"Explain major paper-quality parameters."},{"text":"Perform or interpret common paper laboratory tests."},{"text":"Understand coating-quality characteristics."},{"text":"Apply SPC to manufacturing data."},{"text":"Calculate basic process capability."},{"text":"Perform root-cause analysis."},{"text":"Understand CAPA and non-conformance management."},{"text":"Understand ISO-based quality systems."},{"text":"Prepare quality reports."},{"text":"Analyze customer complaints."},{"text":"Use Excel confidently."},{"text":"Use Minitab/JMP for statistical analysis."},{"text":"Build Power BI quality dashboards."},{"text":"Understand LIMS/QMS workflows."},{"text":"Complete 2–3 quality-engineering projects."},{"text":"Gain practical paper-mill or manufacturing internship experience."}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile for a future Quality Manager in this sector is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Pulp & Paper Technology","Quality Engineering","SPC/Six Sigma","Laboratory Testing","QMS","Process Analytics","Leadership"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should build toward becoming a technical quality leader, not simply a laboratory tester."},{"type":"h","text":"